menuconfig INPUT_FINGERPRINT
	bool "Fingerprint sensors"
	help
	  Say Y here to get to see options for fingerprint sensor drivers.
	  These only provide GPIO, interrupt and key event plumbing for vendor
	  fingerprint HALs; the sensors themselves are driven by TrustZone.

